{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/413660-valid-targets","id":413660,"title":"Valid Targets","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-20T20:55:52-08:00","id":413660,"title":"Valid Targets","content":"So, some questions that have come up in two of my current games, once as a player, and one as Storyteller.<br /> <br /> Does Knockout Punch work on things that can't be rendered unconscious through normal means? I ruled no, a common sense ruling, in my opinion.<br /> <br /> Can you use Glory and Terror to give Insensate to Angels specifically? I'm the player in this game. If I was ST, I'd rule no, as it would essentially make all Angel encounters completely Trivial. On the same note, I'd allow it to function normally against other supernatural entities that aren't ephemeral.<br /> <br /> Does Raise Dead work on non 'vanilla mortals'? Vampires? Mages? Demons?<br /> <br /> What about Stigmatics?<br /> <br /> How would all of you rule these things?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T21:01:19-08:00","id":413680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/413660-valid-targets#post413660\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does Raise Dead work on [\u2026] Demons?</div> </div> </div> </div>No soul, no rez.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T22:47:33-08:00","id":413826,"title":"","content":"I would say you can't normally use &quot;Glory and Terror&quot; on angel since the wording implies you have to do something to reinforce how terrifying you are to the subject. Since Angels are like you, except technically more powerful since they still have a connection to the GM, I would say you can't normally use it effectively against an angel. That being said I might allow it if you are doing something big and make a really hard check. In which case maybe the angel views this as a scene where continued conflict is inadvisable. Though it might also be an interesting excuse to bring a new player into the group if you inspire sufficient terror that the angel's self preservation kicks in and it falls.<br /> <br /> I would say knockout punch doesn't work against targets that can't be knocked out.<br /> <br /> As Satchel said if the person's soul is unavailable for whatever reason then the person can't be raised. That being said you can still raise something if you have a sufficiently intact corpse, a quiet location, and some time.The exploit explicitly mentions that you can put a different soul in the body if the demon has one available, and will actually attract one if they dramatically botch the attempt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}